---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const CONTACT_EMAIL = "dev.solanki.works@gmail.com";
const lastUpdated = "August 17, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use — How Rich Is Too Rich"
  description="Terms of use for How Rich Is Too Rich."
  path="/terms"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink/50">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="mt-6">
      By using How Rich Is Too Rich (the "Site"), you agree to these terms. If you don't agree,
      please don't use the Site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Nature of the content</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      The Site is a work of satire and entertainment. Net worth figures, price tags, and
      comparisons are illustrative estimates for gameplay purposes only and should not be relied on
      as financial, investment, or factual reporting of any kind. See our
      <a href="/disclaimer" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink">disclaimer</a> for more.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Acceptable use</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Don't use the Site to violate any law, to scrape or republish its content at scale without
      permission, or to attempt to disrupt or reverse engineer it beyond normal browser use.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">No warranty</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      The Site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We don't guarantee it will be
      uninterrupted, error-free, or fit for any particular purpose.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any damages arising from your
      use of the Site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Changes</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site after changes means
      you accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="font-mono text-amber underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>